<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Does Jesus care when my way is dark</l><l>With a nameless dread and fear?</l><l>As the daylight fades</l><l>Into deep night shades,</l><l>Does He care enough to be near?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Does Jesus care when I’ve tried and failed</l><l>To resist some temptation strong;</l><l>When for my deep grief</l><l>There is no relief,</l><l>Though my tears flow all the night long?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Does Jesus care when I’ve said “goodbye”</l><l>To the dearest on earth to me,</l><l>And my sad heart aches</l><l>Till it nearly breaks,</l><l>Is it aught to Him? Does He see?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
